1
01:10:35,320 --> 01:10:38,560
I looked for her all over the house, from the cellar to the attic,

2
01:10:38,840 --> 01:10:40,600
I asked the maid to call Warner.

3
01:10:40,760 --> 01:10:42,600
Lieutenant Anderson needs to be briefed.

4
01:10:44,400 --> 01:10:47,040
Davenport here. We're in trouble.

5
01:10:48,120 --> 01:10:49,760
For starters, I've been drugged.

6
01:10:51,360 --> 01:10:54,600
I lost my knowledge and they took the opportunity to kidnap Miss Van Gorder.

7
01:10:56,360 --> 01:10:58,160
Why don't you call Anderson and let him know.

8
01:10:59,360 --> 01:11:01,080
He's not home? Dimana dia?

9
01:11:02,120 --> 01:11:04,000
On a case? What case?

10
01:11:05,400 --> 01:11:06,480
Dr. Wells?

11
01:11:07,440 --> 01:11:08,880
Do you have any other details?

12
01:11:09,280 --> 01:11:12,040
Ayo cepat. We have to find Miss Cornelia.

13
01:11:16,080 --> 01:11:18,040
Lieutenant Anderson is on another case.

14
01:11:18,720 --> 01:11:22,000
Dr. Wells was found dead next to his garage, killed.

15
01:11:24,960 --> 01:11:26,720
There is something strange about this murder,

16
01:11:27,200 --> 01:11:28,560
but the dispatcher doesn't want to expand.

17
01:11:29,160 --> 01:11:30,520
Warner is not in his room,

18
01:11:30,800 --> 01:11:31,960
No sign of him anywhere.

19
01:11:32,200 --> 01:11:33,760
And I was supposed to be watching this guy.

20
01:11:33,920 --> 01:11:36,920
Where is Miss Cornelia? Aku harap aku tahu!

21
01:11:37,480 --> 01:11:40,520
Did you say that the safety chain the safety chain was removed?

22
01:11:42,320 --> 01:11:44,120
So Ms. Van Gorder had to go out for a little while.

23
01:11:44,360 --> 01:11:45,720
What a crazy idea!

24
01:11:45,840 --> 01:11:47,280
Mari terus mencari.

25
01:11:48,080 --> 01:11:50,440
Help, I can't breathe!

26
01:11:51,360 --> 01:11:52,880
There's no air left!

27
01:12:07,520 --> 01:12:10,160
The light is on in a room on the second floor.

28
01:12:11,000 --> 01:12:12,120
Did you go up there tonight?

29
01:12:12,360 --> 01:12:15,320
Of course, but I made sure to turn off the lights before I came down.

30
01:12:15,480 --> 01:12:17,520
Maybe it was Miss Cornelia who turned the lights back on.

31
01:12:17,760 --> 01:12:19,600
We have to look up there first.

32
01:12:48,600 --> 01:12:50,760
Here, Lizzie. Aku disini.

33
01:12:54,880 --> 01:12:57,920
Above the shelf of the fireplace.

34
01:13:01,000 --> 01:13:02,960
We're in front of the fireplace. Apa yang kita lakukan sekarang?

35
01:13:03,720 --> 01:13:04,880
Above the shelf.

36
01:13:05,920 --> 01:13:10,200
There is a molding, tap it with your fist.

37
01:13:14,960 --> 01:13:17,080
But which moulding is it exactly?

38
01:13:18,000 --> 01:13:20,600
I don't know...

39
01:13:23,440 --> 01:13:27,600
It doesn't matter which one. Let's try them all.

40
01:13:46,040 --> 01:13:49,440
Come on, it's all right now.

41
01:13:58,240 --> 01:13:59,280
Merasa lebih baik?

42
01:13:59,480 --> 01:14:03,160
- We'll take you to your room. - No, I can stay here, I'm fine.

43
01:14:04,240 --> 01:14:06,440
How good it is to be able to breathe without any effort.

44
01:14:07,520 --> 01:14:09,680
You know, it's when you run out of oxygen you run out of oxygen,

45
01:14:09,960 --> 01:14:12,400
that you realize how lucky you are to be able to breathe,

46
01:14:12,680 --> 01:14:15,280
This secret room is as hermetic as a box.

47
01:14:15,560 --> 01:14:19,320
When the chimney is closed, it's as if all the air has escaped.

48
01:14:19,880 --> 01:14:21,240
Careful, it's closing again!

49
01:14:21,360 --> 01:14:23,680
Don't hold it back, it opens from the inside.

50
01:14:28,160 --> 01:14:30,480
The controls were hidden behind this floor plan.

51
01:14:31,280 --> 01:14:33,160
They activate a motor that is located under the hatch here.

52
01:14:33,720 --> 01:14:35,760
One of the controls blocks the door open.

53
01:14:37,000 --> 01:14:40,160
And I'll bet the fireplace in the other room room, opens the same way.

54
01:14:42,880 --> 01:14:44,240
What did I say!

55
01:14:46,960 --> 01:14:48,320
Orders, you say? I've been looking and can't find anything.
